Guide for this POJO Classes Function

Deserialized the payload JSON response using getters and setter with parent class, child class, and sub-child class.

Parent Class:
*GetCoursePOJO.java

Child Class
*CoursePOJO

Sub-Child Class
*WebAutomation.java
*Mobile.java
*API.java

install also "jackson-databind" dependency on pom.xml

To fulfill this POJO Classes function run execute "OAuthCourse.java"



*******************************************************************************
Array - stores non-incremental data
ArrayList - stores incremental data


